'''Portblanc Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Portblanc}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: PBL, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: PBIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Portblanc]], the capital of [[Tramuntana Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport is located on the [[Shendan Ocean]] coast in the [[Cala Tranquilla]] comarca and is the principal air gateway to the Tramuntana highland region. It is jet-capable and is served by [[Aeroístmus]] from both hubs, with onward service to [[Sant Jorge Airport|Sant Jorge]].

